{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1199471-amanojaku-underused-villain","id":1199471,"title":"Amanojaku: Underused Villain?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-25T14:05:58-07:00","id":1199471,"title":"Amanojaku: Underused Villain?","content":"While reading &quot;Ten Nights Dreaming and The Cat's Grave&quot; by Natsume Soseki I encountered a mythological figure called Amanojaku. Looking this character on Wikipedia it seems that Amanojaku is a malicious trickster who shows up in myths, legends, fairy tales, ghost stories, and eyewitness accounts. The last two aren't mentioned by Wikipedia.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know more about Amanojaku? Has anyone used him in a game? Does anyone have stats?<br /> <br /> Thanks all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-25T16:35:30-07:00","id":1199527,"title":"","content":"It looks like it's race of dangerous creatures, not a single being. Stats would be like Oni or Tengu, which I think were in first edition, but not in second edition so far.<br /> Here's more info: <a href=\"http://yokai.com/amanojaku/\" target=\"_blank\">http://yokai.com/amanojaku/</a><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5627-purple-snit","name":"Purple Snit","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5627_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"309"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-26T12:03:04-07:00","id":1199784,"title":"","content":"Amanojaku would be a Titan spawn race. Amanozako/Amanosagume would be the Titan who did the spawning. Susano-o is capable of ruthless cruelty, but he does believe in discipline over himself. Toward that end he vomited up those dark impulses he couldn\u2019t master. An emodiment of the Passion Purview, that Created Scion grew into a full blown Titan. Rapacity and Submission.<br /> <br /> A Titan embodying the failure of stoicism and loss of control seems an appropriate antagonist for the Kami.<br /> <br /> (Ps: I just discovered my phone thinks that Kami is Alamo)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-26-2018, 03:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}